    skos:definition "厚朴、生姜、半夏、甘草、人参，主治脾虚气滞腹胀证、汗后腹胀满按之不痛者。"@zh ;
    skos:altLabel "厚朴七物汤"@zh, "治出汗后肚子胀的汤"@zh ;
    skos:exactMatch fj:HouPoShengJiangBanXiaGanCaoRenShenTang .

fjs:ZhiZiChiTang_Concept
    a skos:Concept ;
