    skos:definition "栀子豉汤加甘草，主治热郁胸膈兼少气、虚烦懊憹少气者。"@zh ;
    skos:altLabel "栀甘汤"@zh ;
    skos:exactMatch fj:ZhiZiGanCaoTang .

fjs:ZhiZiShengJiangTang_Concept
